The content files are derived from the RoboCup@Home RuleBook
(https://github.com/RoboCupAtHome/RuleBook), which is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
Skill descriptions and point values are taken from its scoresheets, so the
share-alike terms carry over and that content cannot be relicensed here.

The rulebook itself is NOT redistributed by this repository. It is referenced as
a pinned git submodule at external/RuleBook and remains under its own license.
